{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/606631-siring-little-abominations","id":606631,"title":"Siring Little Abominations?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-29T08:21:09-07:00","id":606631,"title":"Siring Little Abominations?","content":"Alright, so pretty much anybody who's picked up a book about ancient mythology is familiar with one thing about the gods; They are near omnisexual.<br /> <br /> Unable to recognize what is appropriate to sleep with, some of the gods have produced terrible monsters that tend to threaten the world if left unchecked. Loki can't seem to catch a break, being the father of both Fenrir and the Midgard serpent, as well as the mother of Sleipnir. I don't know why, but a lot of his children keep coming out as animals.<br /> <br /> <br /> So I have two questions:<br /> <br /> 1 - Any stories in which your Scions have produced unnatural creatures after promiscuous acts?<br /> <br /> 2 - What would your Scion be willing to sleep with? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 07-29-2015, 11:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T12:56:23-07:00","id":608365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/606631-siring-little-abominations#post606631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unable to recognize what is appropriate to sleep with, some of the gods have produced terrible monsters that tend to threaten the world if left unchecked. Loki can't seem to catch a break, being the father of both Fenrir and the Midgard serpent, as well as the mother of Sleipnir. I don't know why, but a lot of his children keep coming out as animals.</div> </div> </div> </div>You make it sound like siring world-devouring apocalypse beasts is something that Loki would not be hella jazzed about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T13:35:34-07:00","id":608395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/606631-siring-little-abominations#post606631\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Alright, so pretty much anybody who's picked up a book about ancient mythology is familiar with one thing about the gods; They are near omnisexual.<br /> <br /> Unable to recognize what is appropriate to sleep with, some of the gods have produced terrible monsters that tend to threaten the world if left unchecked. Loki can't seem to catch a break, being the father of both Fenrir and the Midgard serpent, as well as the mother of Sleipnir. I don't know why, but a lot of his children keep coming out as animals.<br /> <br /> <br /> So I have two questions:<br /> <br /> 1 - Any stories in which your Scions have produced unnatural creatures after promiscuous acts?<br /> <br /> 2 - What would your Scion be willing to sleep with? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>In a Scion: Ragnarok game, my character let himself be seduced by some troll-wives. He sired an interesting little brood to say the least, going from a dragon to a tentacled svartalar and a few little jarnvidjur.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-03T08:02:01-07:00","id":613365,"title":"","content":"Well, no offspring had come up by the time the game i played puttered out, but my Scion of Hel did end up developing a hilariously surprising philandering streak and, beside a number of ladies rescued during the band's misadventures, got himself involved with a female fenrir (capable of assuming a mostly human form), a shinigami and one of the gorgons, Stheno. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> In fact in a particularly weird twist, Euryale tried to get into it too, though intending to manipulate/seduce him into helping with a crazy scheme to steal Medusa's face out of Athena's Aegis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 08-03-2015, 12:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}